## 7. Page-by-page content brief

### 7.1 `index.html` (Home)

1. **Header (all pages):** logo on navy at left, nav links (Home, Services, About, Gallery, Contact), and a persistent "Call 0431 150 545" button. On mobile the nav collapses to a toggle, but the call button stays visible outside the menu.
2. **Hero (navy):**
